r of destiny's intensely dramatic  week to week story looks like we're  going to be spending a lot of time with  the gabal empress kaitol because she's  got light suppressing tech she can wield  against these new hive guardians you  want us to hit them just don't use that  stuff on us thanks and let's not forget  which queen is also giving us a new raid  on march 5th just a couple of weeks  after launch not that we could forget  we've got it marked on our calendar the  witch queen and season of the risen  marked the start of the busiest year  ever for destiny and judging by how hard  bungie is mixing things up right now i'm  not sure anyone can guess what they've  got in store for us this year but our  bodies are ready just don't say  i didn't warn you
 

